    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kollectomaniac is a game about running a shop in the woods on a log. You work for a man named Dlarlnod, your landlord.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Work at my shop for free, all you have to do is pay me rent every four days.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Dlarlnod</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You buy items from weird people called Walkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are nine walkers, each with distinct and slightly random personalities.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These personalities change how skittish they are, affect item prices, and give each walker a distinct feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/91141c736f09b2b56af9de15d92dd77a.avif?t=1754773081\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/d7c170b10b8f0cb1176a31cfb826a5c1.poster.avif?t=1754773081\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/d7c170b10b8f0cb1176a31cfb826a5c1.webm?t=1754773081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/d7c170b10b8f0cb1176a31cfb826a5c1.mp4?t=1754773081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough starts the same: You purchase your first items, and spend any leftover money on the &quot;Display Stand&quot;, which lets you sell those items back to the walkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>By saving up money and learning the average price of items, you can spend any spare cents at the shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/2cddc95a3eb0709a1cbba67f7087ca08.avif?t=1754773081\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/37b431dd46c3ff0accf070fc77c461b8.poster.avif?t=1754773081\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/37b431dd46c3ff0accf070fc77c461b8.webm?t=1754773081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/37b431dd46c3ff0accf070fc77c461b8.mp4?t=1754773081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The worm sells various items including hats, mechanical &quot;statistic trackers&quot; and items you can use during the buying and selling phase of the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the Goal? Survive.<br>Every five days is <strong><i>Collection Day.</i></strong>\u00a0If you can't make Collection Day:\u00a0You must surrender...</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kollectomaniac is a game about running a shop in the woods on a log. You work for a man named Dlarlnod, your landlord.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Work at my shop for free, all you have to do is pay me rent every four days.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>-Dlarlnod</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You buy items from weird people called Walkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are nine walkers, each with distinct and slightly random personalities.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These personalities change how skittish they are, affect item prices, and give each walker a distinct feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/91141c736f09b2b56af9de15d92dd77a.avif?t=1754773081\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/d7c170b10b8f0cb1176a31cfb826a5c1.poster.avif?t=1754773081\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/d7c170b10b8f0cb1176a31cfb826a5c1.webm?t=1754773081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/d7c170b10b8f0cb1176a31cfb826a5c1.mp4?t=1754773081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough starts the same: You purchase your first items, and spend any leftover money on the &quot;Display Stand&quot;, which lets you sell those items back to the walkers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>By saving up money and learning the average price of items, you can spend any spare cents at the shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/2cddc95a3eb0709a1cbba67f7087ca08.avif?t=1754773081\" data-has-big width=800 height=112 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/37b431dd46c3ff0accf070fc77c461b8.poster.avif?t=1754773081\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/37b431dd46c3ff0accf070fc77c461b8.webm?t=1754773081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3491740/extras/37b431dd46c3ff0accf070fc77c461b8.mp4?t=1754773081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The worm sells various items including hats, mechanical &quot;statistic trackers&quot; and items you can use during the buying and selling phase of the game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's the Goal? Survive.<br>Every five days is <strong><i>Collection Day.</i></strong>\u00a0If you can't make Collection Day:\u00a0You must surrender...</p>",
    "short_description": "Kollectomaniac is an early access shopkeeping roguelike where you buy and sell items to strange travelers called Walkers. Haggle by day to profit; by night, upgrade your shop, explore, solve puzzles, gamble, and even sell your organs. Every four days is Collection Day\u2014pay up, or lose.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
